casebook chained-demo v1
source "quorum fixture: timed readings that watch timed readings" dated 2026-10-26 by "quorum project"
note "A bearing that ran hot in the last minute is suspect. If that happens twice in an hour the bearing is failing."
note "A restart within 2 minutes of the bearing having been hot is a hot restart, and two hot restarts in an hour"
note "lock the motor out. The readings are declared out of order on purpose: cbc orders the table so each timed"
note "reading comes after those it watches."

observe motor_started "the motor start command is on"
observe bearing_hot   "bearing temperature above the limit"
observe sensor_check  "the bearing sensor failed its last check"
observe test_run      "a maintenance test run is in progress"

reading hot_restarts "two hot restarts within an hour" when hot_restart 2 times in 1h
reading hot_restart  "a start within 2 minutes of the bearing having been hot" when motor_started within 2m after ran_hot
reading ran_hot      "the bearing was hot at some point in the last minute" when bearing_hot within last 1m
reading hot_twice    "the bearing ran hot twice within an hour" when ran_hot 2 times in 1h
reading suspect      "the bearing was still being watched in the last 2 minutes" when ran_hot within last 2m

claim overheating "bearing hot now" severity 7 needs bearing_hot
claim cooling     "bearing ran hot recently" severity 3 needs ran_hot
claim settling    "bearing under watch until it has been cool for a while" severity 2 needs suspect
claim failing     "the bearing keeps running hot" severity 6 needs hot_twice
claim restarted   "restarted while hot" severity 5 needs hot_restart
claim lockout     "repeated hot restarts: do not restart" severity 9 needs hot_restarts

excuse testing "a start during a maintenance test is expected" needs test_run
testing undercuts restarted

doubt sensor_bad "the bearing sensor cannot be trusted" needs sensor_check
  undermines bearing_hot ran_hot hot_twice hot_restart hot_restarts suspect

action run idle
action watch when any cooling settling
action alarm when any failing restarted
action stop safe when any overheating lockout
prefer stop over alarm over watch over run
